          :alt: Waveshare RP2350-Matrix details

   * - .. container:: twocol

          .. container:: leftside

             1. :strong:`RP2350A`
             #. | :strong:`On-board flash memory`
                | 16㎆ NOR-Flash :strong:`P25Q128HA-SUH-IR` (W25Q128JV)
             #. | :strong:`QMI8658A`
                | 6D MEMS IMU sensor (3-axis accelerometer, 3-axis gyroscope)
             #. | :strong:`Dout pin`
                | for extending RGB matrix
             #. :strong:`RESET button`

          .. container:: rightside

             6. | :strong:`USB Type-C connector`
                | Supports USB1.1 hosts and slave devices
             #. | :strong:`BOOT button`
                | press it when resetting to enter download mode
             #. | :strong:`ME6217C33`
                | 800㎃ low dropout, low noise, ultra-fast LDO
             #. | :strong:`8×8 WS2812B`
                | cascaded RGB LED matrix

